    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Fluid-主题文章渲染测试"><a href="#Fluid-主题文章渲染测试" class="headerlink" title="Fluid 主题文章渲染测试"></a>Fluid 主题文章渲染测试</h1><p>这是一篇根据 <a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/guide/">Fluid 主题官方文档</a> 编写的示例文章，旨在<del>全面</del>测试并展示主题所支持的<del>所有</del>内容格式和增强标签。</p><h2 id="基础-Markdown-语法"><a href="#基础-Markdown-语法" class="headerlink" title="基础 Markdown 语法"></a>基础 Markdown 语法</h2><p>这是所有 Markdown 编辑器都支持的标准语法。</p><h2 id="标题"><a href="#标题" class="headerlink" title="标题"></a>标题</h2><h1 id="H1"><a href="#H1" class="headerlink" title="H1"></a>H1</h1><h2 id="H2"><a href="#H2" class="headerlink" title="H2"></a>H2</h2><h3 id="H3"><a href="#H3" class="headerlink" title="H3"></a>H3</h3><h4 id="H4"><a href="#H4" class="headerlink" title="H4"></a>H4</h4><h5 id="H5"><a href="#H5" class="headerlink" title="H5"></a>H5</h5><h6 id="H6"><a href="#H6" class="headerlink" title="H6"></a>H6</h6><h2 id="文本样式"><a href="#文本样式" class="headerlink" title="文本样式"></a>文本样式</h2><ul><li><strong>粗体</strong></li><li><em>斜体</em></li><li><code>行内代码</code></li><li><del>删除线</del></li><li><u>下划线</u> (通过 HTML <code>&lt;u&gt;</code> 标签实现)</li></ul><h2 id="分割线"><a href="#分割线" class="headerlink" title="分割线"></a>分割线</h2><hr><h2 id="引用"><a href="#引用" class="headerlink" title="引用"></a>引用</h2><blockquote><p>这是一个引用块。</p><p>—— Fluid</p></blockquote><h2 id="列表"><a href="#列表" class="headerlink" title="列表"></a>列表</h2><h4 id="无序列表"><a href="#无序列表" class="headerlink" title="无序列表"></a>无序列表</h4><ul><li>无序列表 1</li><li>无序列表 2<ul><li>嵌套无序列表</li></ul></li></ul><h4 id="有序列表"><a href="#有序列表" class="headerlink" title="有序列表"></a>有序列表</h4><ol><li>有序列表 1</li><li>有序列表 2<ol><li>嵌套有序列表</li></ol></li></ol><h2 id="链接"><a href="#链接" class="headerlink" title="链接"></a>链接</h2><p>这是一个<a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/">链接</a>，指向Fluid官方</p><h2 id="图片"><a href="#图片" class="headerlink" title="图片"></a>图片</h2><p><img src="https://pic.skzxi.top/vscode/editor.jpg" alt="这是图片描述"></p><h2 id="表格"><a href="#表格" class="headerlink" title="表格"></a>表格</h2><table><thead><tr><th align="left">表头 1</th><th align="left">居左</th><th align="center">居中</th><th align="right">居右</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">单元格</td><td align="left">单元格</td><td align="center">单元格</td><td align="right">单元格</td></tr><tr><td align="left">单元格</td><td align="left">单元格</td><td align="center">单元格</td><td align="right">单元格</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="代码块"><a href="#代码块" class="headerlink" title="代码块"></a>代码块</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span>():<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, Fluid!&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:<br>    main()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="Fluid-增强标签"><a href="#Fluid-增强标签" class="headerlink" title="Fluid 增强标签"></a>Fluid 增强标签</h2><p>Fluid 主题通过 Hexo 的标签插件（Tag Plugins）扩展了许多功能。</p><h2 id="Note-便签"><a href="#Note-便签" class="headerlink" title="Note 便签"></a>Note 便签</h2><div class="note note-primary">            <p><strong>主要提示</strong><br>这是 <code>primary</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-secondary">            <p><strong>中级提示</strong><br>这是 <code>secondary</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-success">            <p><strong>成功提示</strong><br>这是 <code>success</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-info">            <p><strong>信息提示</strong><br>这是 <code>info</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-warning">            <p><strong>警告提示</strong><br>这是 <code>warning</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-danger">            <p><strong>危险提示</strong><br>这是 <code>danger</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><div class="note note-light">            <p><strong>明亮提示（？</strong><br>这是 <code>light</code> 样式的提示。</p>          </div><h2 id="Label-行内标签"><a href="#Label-行内标签" class="headerlink" title="Label 行内标签"></a>Label 行内标签</h2><span class="label label-default">default</span><span class="label label-primary">Primary</span><span class="label label-success">Success</span><span class="label label-info">Info</span><span class="label label-warning">Warning</span><span class="label label-danger">Danger</span><h2 id="勾选框"><a href="#勾选框" class="headerlink" title="勾选框"></a>勾选框</h2><div>            <input type="checkbox"  >普通示例          </div><div>            <input type="checkbox"  checked="checked">默认选中          </div>            <input type="checkbox"  >内联示例           后面文字不换行<h2 id="按钮"><a href="#按钮" class="headerlink" title="按钮"></a>按钮</h2><p>这是一个<a class="btn" href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/"  title="访问Fluid官网" target="_blank">按钮</a></p><h2 id="组图"><a href="#组图" class="headerlink" title="组图"></a>组图</h2><div class="group-image-container"><div class="group-image-row"><div class="group-image-wrap"><img src="https://pic.skzxi.top/vscode/editor.jpg"></div><div class="group-image-wrap"><img src="https://pic.fallingstar.xyz/vscode/sidebar.jpg"></div><div class="group-image-wrap"><img src="https://pic.fallingstar.xyz/vscode/panel.png"></div></div><div class="group-image-row"><div class="group-image-wrap"><img src="https://pic.skzxi.top/vscode/editor.jpg"></div><div class="group-image-wrap"><img src="https://pic.fallingstar.xyz/vscode/sidebar.jpg"></div></div></div><h2 id="Fold-折叠块"><a href="#Fold-折叠块" class="headerlink" title="Fold 折叠块"></a>Fold 折叠块</h2>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-info collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>info样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-primary collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>primary样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-default collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>default样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-success collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>success样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-warning collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>warning样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div>    <div class="fold">      <div class="fold-title fold-danger collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-5eba3a69" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-arrow">▶</div>danger样式      </div>      <div class="fold-collapse collapse" id="collapse-5eba3a69">        <div class="fold-content">          <p>这是折叠的内容，支持 markdown</p>        </div>      </div>    </div><h2 id="Mermaid-图表"><a href="#Mermaid-图表" class="headerlink" title="Mermaid 图表"></a>Mermaid 图表</h2><pre><code class="mermaid" >ganttdateFormat  YYYY-MM-DDtitle Adding GANTT diagram to mermaidsection A sectionCompleted task            :done,    des1, 2014-01-06,2014-01-08Active task               :active,  des2, 2014-01-09, 3dFuture task               :         des3, after des2, 5dFuture task2               :         des4, after des3, 5d</code></pre><h2 id="数学公式"><a href="#数学公式" class="headerlink" title="数学公式"></a>数学公式</h2><p>行内公式： $E&#x3D;mc^2$</p><p>块级公式：</p><p>$$<br>\frac{\partial u}{\partial t} &#x3D; h^2 \left( \frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial x^2} + \frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial y^2} + \frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial z^2} \right)<br>$$</p><h2 id="注脚"><a href="#注脚" class="headerlink" title="注脚"></a>注脚</h2><p>本文参考fluid用户手册<sup id="fnref:1" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:1" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="用户手册链接https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/">[1]</span></a></sup>编写<br>这是一句话<sup id="fnref:2" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:2" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="这是注脚">[2]</span></a></sup></p><section class="footnotes"><div class="footnote-list"><ol><li><span id="fn:1" class="footnote-text"><span>用户手册链接<a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/">https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/</a><a href="#fnref:1" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:2" class="footnote-text"><span>这是注脚<a href="#fnref:2" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li></ol></div></section>]]></content>
    
    
    
